                            <comment id="15945182" author="miracle.max" created="Tue, 28 Mar 2017 13:38:07 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I&apos;m testing &lt;em&gt;0.7.1.-rc3&lt;/em&gt;, I migrated previous notebook from Zeppelin &lt;em&gt;0.6.0&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I tried&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Started &amp;amp; stopped Zeppelin and graphs mode persist as configured.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Change one paragraph from scatterChart to stackedAreaChart and after the restart all notebooks defaults to table. (I notice previous keys and groups configurations are lost too)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;The strange thing is that I still see the mode graph I configured in the note.json for all paragraphs&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;        &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;results&quot;&lt;/span&gt;: [
          {
            &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;graph&quot;&lt;/span&gt;: {
              &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;mode&quot;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;stackedAreaChart&quot;&lt;/span&gt;,
              &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;height&quot;&lt;/span&gt;: 300.0,
              &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;optionOpen&quot;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
            },
            &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;helium&quot;&lt;/span&gt;: {}
          }
        ],
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15947200" author="miracle.max" created="Wed, 29 Mar 2017 14:12:50 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I found out a workaround, if I clone the notebook, the new copy persist graph and configurations. (the original version keeps breaking after Zeppelin restart)&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
