	&lt;li&gt;last commit: &lt;tt&gt;d4cacada - (HEAD -&amp;gt; branch-0.7, origin/branch-0.7) fix bugs for timer saver (2 days ago) &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;LeiWang&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/12863531/12863531_2315.gif&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15969813" author="1ambda" created="Sat, 15 Apr 2017 04:49:56 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Let me test one more.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15970752" author="1ambda" created="Mon, 17 Apr 2017 07:05:34 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;reproduced in 0.7.1-bin&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15970770" author="1ambda" created="Mon, 17 Apr 2017 07:32:12 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Found the cause.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;when Zeppelin loads / imports a note, it always converts &lt;tt&gt;note.json&lt;/tt&gt; regardless it&apos;s already done or not&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</comment>
